contentText:
It looks like there&#8217;s no hard feelings between A$AP Rocky and FERG over the latter&#8217;s decision to change his name and the former&#8217;s subsequent comments regarding said name change.

FERG took to his Instagram feed to announce that the follow-up to his third solo album Darold is finished and put out an APB for a distributor. &#8220;I just finished my new album,&#8221; he wrote in a screenshot that he posted. &#8220;Who wants to distribute it?&#8221;

